 "pages": {
  "default/30956.htm": {
   "file": "default/30956.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Musician Nanarin: Everyone in this world has a soul mate, another half, their lifelong companion, their true love. This may sound like a silly love song, but it's true. Once more I am dreaming of my prince with a song in my heart.",
   "header": "Musician Nanarin",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Tell me about your prince.\"",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 1",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/30956-1.htm"
    },
    {
     "text": "Quest",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Quest",
     "kind": "quest-menu",
     "to": "@questlist"
    }
   ]
  },
  "default/30956-1.htm": {
   "file": "default/30956-1.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Musician Nanarin: The man I love has broad shoulders, a thick, lush beard and a beautifully weathered face, seasoned by a life of adventure. Why? Does this shock you?",
   "header": "Musician Nanarin",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Return",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 0",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/30956.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00362_BardsMandolin/30956-01.html": {
   "file": "Q00362_BardsMandolin/30956-01.html",
   "quest": 362,
   "text": "Musician Nanarin: What, another package from Bard Swan ? Oh, my, this is especially beautiful! Hey, you aren't waiting around for a reply, are you? I appreciate all the flutes, but the Bard really isn't my type! Please tell him that my knight in shining armor is someone else!",
   "header": "Musician Nanarin",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memo 4; has items 4317"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00362_BardsMandolin/30956-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00362_BardsMandolin/30956-02.html",
   "quest": 362,
   "text": "Musician Nanarin: What am I to do about Bard Swan? I don't want to hurt his feelings but I am not attracted to him at all!",
   "header": "Musician Nanarin",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; !(st.isMemoState(4) && st.hasQuestItems(SWANS_FLUTE, SWANS_LETTER)); st.getMemoState() >= 5"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00363_SorrowfulSoundOfFlute/30956-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00363_SorrowfulSoundOfFlute/30956-01.htm",
   "quest": 363,
   "text": "Musician Nanarin: I must admit that his broad shoulders take my breath away, and that lovely beard of his has captured my soul... What can I do? I've never felt this way before... Could you please help me?",
